  "summary": "Merges drag-lint diagnostics, completion, hover and definition into a DelphiLSP proxy session",
  "intro": "Read this when you run an editor against DelphiLSP and want drag-lint answers merged into the same session. lsp --proxy forwards to DelphiLSP and the merge flags add drag-lint results.",
